[
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.640",
    "end": "00:00:06.950",
    "text": "hello we are here today with"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:06.960",
    "end": "00:00:10.250",
    "text": "award-winning physicist Niels Bohr"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:10.260",
    "end": "00:00:12.470",
    "text": "it's a pleasure to be here"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:12.480",
    "end": "00:00:14.030",
    "text": "could you begin by telling us a bit"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:14.040",
    "end": "00:00:17.269",
    "text": "about yourself and your accomplishments"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:17.279",
    "end": "00:00:20.090",
    "text": "and my name of course is Neil's einrich"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.100",
    "end": "00:00:22.189",
    "text": "David"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:22.199",
    "end": "00:00:24.050",
    "text": "October 7th 8"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:24.060",
    "end": "00:00:25.670",
    "text": "th I studied at the University of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:25.680",
    "end": "00:00:27.710",
    "text": "Copenhagen is that a very prestigious"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:27.720",
    "end": "00:00:28.910",
    "text": "School"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:28.920",
    "end": "00:00:30.589",
    "text": "oh yes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:30.599",
    "end": "00:00:33.229",
    "text": "that must be very interesting"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.239",
    "end": "00:00:36.950",
    "text": "it was truly a great experience"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:36.960",
    "end": "00:00:39.110",
    "text": "now Mr Bohr I know that it is almost 20"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.120",
    "end": "00:00:42.470",
    "text": "years after World War II yes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.480",
    "end": "00:00:44.209",
    "text": "but what would you consider the most"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:44.219",
    "end": "00:00:46.970",
    "text": "important event following the war"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:46.980",
    "end": "00:00:48.950",
    "text": "well as you know after World War One"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.960",
    "end": "00:00:51.709",
    "text": "scientific and technological discoveries"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:51.719",
    "end": "00:00:53.630",
    "text": "have been occurring rapidly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:53.640",
    "end": "00:00:56.990",
    "text": "this is also true after World War II"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.000",
    "end": "00:00:58.850",
    "text": "I'd have to say that the advances in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:58.860",
    "end": "00:01:00.770",
    "text": "nuclear technology significantly"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:00.780",
    "end": "00:01:03.049",
    "text": "affected the advancements in the world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:03.059",
    "end": "00:01:04.250",
    "text": "today"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:04.260",
    "end": "00:01:06.289",
    "text": "why would you say that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.299",
    "end": "00:01:08.530",
    "text": "from what I've seen from this world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:08.540",
    "end": "00:01:12.109",
    "text": "nuclear energy can be an effect a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.119",
    "end": "00:01:15.050",
    "text": "significant source of energy and is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15.060",
    "end": "00:01:17.510",
    "text": "being implemented already okay"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:17.520",
    "end": "00:01:19.730",
    "text": "this is true nuclear energy can be a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.740",
    "end": "00:01:21.109",
    "text": "huge source of energy in the future"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.119",
    "end": "00:01:28.850",
    "text": "especially in your home of Scandinavia"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:28.860",
    "end": "00:01:32.090",
    "text": "you seem to know a lot about the subject"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:32.100",
    "end": "00:01:33.649",
    "text": "I was a scientist working on the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:33.659",
    "end": "00:01:40.609",
    "text": "Manhattan Project you know"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:40.619",
    "end": "00:01:42.170",
    "text": "is that so"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.180",
    "end": "00:01:44.210",
    "text": "yes for security reasons I was under the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:44.220",
    "end": "00:01:47.450",
    "text": "Alias of a Nicholas Baker"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.460",
    "end": "00:01:49.490",
    "text": "what was your job"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:49.500",
    "end": "00:01:51.469",
    "text": "I was a consultant they called me Father"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.479",
    "end": "00:01:53.690",
    "text": "Confessor"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.700",
    "end": "00:01:54.969",
    "text": "that's that's"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.979",
    "end": "00:01:57.050",
    "text": "very interesting"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:57.060",
    "end": "00:01:59.330",
    "text": "but why did you go to America"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:59.340",
    "end": "00:02:02.270",
    "text": "you see they didn't need my help"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:02.280",
    "end": "00:02:04.550",
    "text": "they didn't need your help I had vast"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:04.560",
    "end": "00:02:06.950",
    "text": "amounts of knowledge and it was useful"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:06.960",
    "end": "00:02:09.229",
    "text": "to them but I did not build the weapon I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:09.239",
    "end": "00:02:11.570",
    "text": "wasn't merely there for support"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:11.580",
    "end": "00:02:13.430",
    "text": "I think I understand"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:13.440",
    "end": "00:02:15.589",
    "text": "what sort of information about atoms did"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:15.599",
    "end": "00:02:16.550",
    "text": "you give them"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:16.560",
    "end": "00:02:18.830",
    "text": "well I actually know quite a lot about"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.840",
    "end": "00:02:21.170",
    "text": "the subject"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.180",
    "end": "00:02:22.970",
    "text": "I don't doubt that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:22.980",
    "end": "00:02:24.770",
    "text": "my work while I was alive comprised"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.780",
    "end": "00:02:27.110",
    "text": "mostly of quantum mechanics"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:27.120",
    "end": "00:02:32.270",
    "text": "and atomic structures I see"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.280",
    "end": "00:02:34.250",
    "text": "I created the Bohr model of the app"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.260",
    "end": "00:02:36.350",
    "text": "where the electrons travel in orbits"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:36.360",
    "end": "00:02:38.570",
    "text": "around the nucleus likewise the chemical"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.580",
    "end": "00:02:40.490",
    "text": "properties of the element is determined"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:40.500",
    "end": "00:02:41.930",
    "text": "by the number of electrons in its"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:41.940",
    "end": "00:02:48.530",
    "text": "outermost orbit"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.540",
    "end": "00:02:50.030",
    "text": "that's fascinating"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.040",
    "end": "00:02:52.070",
    "text": "isn't it"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.080",
    "end": "00:02:53.509",
    "text": "well what does this have to do with the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:53.519",
    "end": "00:02:55.550",
    "text": "Manhattan Project"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:55.560",
    "end": "00:02:57.770",
    "text": "this sort of understanding of atoms has"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.780",
    "end": "00:02:59.509",
    "text": "a lot to do with nuclear energy and how"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.519",
    "end": "00:03:01.430",
    "text": "it's and its development"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:01.440",
    "end": "00:03:03.650",
    "text": "why do you think they call it the atomic"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:03.660",
    "end": "00:03:04.610",
    "text": "bomb"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.620",
    "end": "00:03:07.430",
    "text": "well all right all right but I still"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.440",
    "end": "00:03:08.570",
    "text": "don't know why you went to America"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.580",
    "end": "00:03:10.790",
    "text": "instead of Britain they wanted you too"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:10.800",
    "end": "00:03:11.750",
    "text": "right"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.760",
    "end": "00:03:13.729",
    "text": "what I said before is true I did not"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.739",
    "end": "00:03:15.350",
    "text": "plan on going to America to build build"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.360",
    "end": "00:03:19.309",
    "text": "a bomb no I wanted a different form of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:19.319",
    "end": "00:03:22.009",
    "text": "ectomic atomic exploitation you see a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.019",
    "end": "00:03:25.490",
    "text": "political form I wanted to guide them"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.500",
    "end": "00:03:26.869",
    "text": "guide them"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.879",
    "end": "00:03:29.030",
    "text": "from making a mistake I could blow open"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.040",
    "end": "00:03:31.550",
    "text": "a door to a disaster"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:31.560",
    "end": "00:03:34.850",
    "text": "what would that be an all-out nuclear"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.860",
    "end": "00:03:36.770",
    "text": "competition the Allies could have won"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.780",
    "end": "00:03:38.570",
    "text": "without the weapon and with it the trust"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:38.580",
    "end": "00:03:40.070",
    "text": "of the Allies would be broken how could"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:40.080",
    "end": "00:03:41.449",
    "text": "they trust each other with that sort of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.459",
    "end": "00:03:43.009",
    "text": "threat"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.019",
    "end": "00:03:44.990",
    "text": "so what does this have to do with peace"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:45.000",
    "end": "00:03:48.350",
    "text": "then you helped them didn't you yes I I"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.360",
    "end": "00:03:50.690",
    "text": "suppose but they didn't get technical"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.700",
    "end": "00:03:52.729",
    "text": "details out of me I gave them math and"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:52.739",
    "end": "00:03:54.229",
    "text": "engineering"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.239",
    "end": "00:03:56.690",
    "text": "I said that the peaceful post-war world"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.700",
    "end": "00:03:59.509",
    "text": "was still possible"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.519",
    "end": "00:04:01.130",
    "text": "is that so"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:01.140",
    "end": "00:04:02.570",
    "text": "how"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.580",
    "end": "00:04:05.330",
    "text": "implementing Arms Control"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:05.340",
    "end": "00:04:08.330",
    "text": "well it seems that your actions made"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:08.340",
    "end": "00:04:10.250",
    "text": "sure the worst possible events did not"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:10.260",
    "end": "00:04:21.770",
    "text": "occur"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.780",
    "end": "00:04:24.290",
    "text": "no I suppose it didn't"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:24.300",
    "end": "00:04:26.210",
    "text": "what sort of contributions did you make"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.220",
    "end": "00:04:27.650",
    "text": "to this field"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:27.660",
    "end": "00:04:29.930",
    "text": "I identified the isotope of uranium that"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:29.940",
    "end": "00:04:32.689",
    "text": "was responsible for slow nuclear fission"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:32.699",
    "end": "00:04:34.670",
    "text": "witches"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:34.680",
    "end": "00:04:42.650",
    "text": "uranium 235"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:42.660",
    "end": "00:04:44.450",
    "text": "thank you for being here with us today"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:44.460",
    "end": "00:04:47.510",
    "text": "Mr born it's been an honor it's been a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.520",
    "end": "00:04:56.230",
    "text": "privilege"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:56.240",
    "end": "00:04:59.660",
    "text": "I love you"
  }
]